254
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:53,440
It's a long fight That's the ultra
violent style of the Funk Brothers.

255
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:56,197
There's not a soul in
the criminal underworld

256
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,977
that doesn't know the
names of these siblings.

257
00:17:59,060 --> 00:18:02,617
And based off what I'm reading, they're
powerful enough to take down pirates!

258
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:04,406
worth over a hundred million.

259
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:07,117
Bunch of squawking colors from over there.

260
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,317
Leave it if it takes all day!

261
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:11,597
They look like nothing but a couple
of two-bit street fighters to me.

262
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,033
I guess we'll find out.

263
00:18:13,180 --> 00:18:15,651
How about you show me what you're made of?

264
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:17,580
I'm talking to you, shrimp.

265
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,020
Brother, no!

266
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:24,377
Geez, pal.

267
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:26,320
So weak!

268
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:29,879
Or perhaps the hub of sweet
armies just overpowered!

269
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,300
But still, how disappointing!

270
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,400
Hey, do you hear me?

271
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:36,720
You let everyone down!

272
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:38,135
You can't pick sides!

273
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:40,057
So, you ready little brother?

274
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,060
Cause you're next! Wait a sec!

275
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:44,240
I don't even know how to fight!

276
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:47,620
I've never done this for real!

277
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,260
Not in my entire life!

278
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:50,360
You will now!

279
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:57,420
He turned his back and cowered!

280
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:59,167
These brothers are pathetic!

281
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:01,960
That broke my accent too.

282
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:03,654
It doesn't make sense.

283
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:06,448
That blade was infused with armament Haki.

284
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:08,940
His body is ridiculously strong.

285
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,380
You okay, bro?

286
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:13,310
That...

287
00:19:13,393 --> 00:19:16,240
that bastard had the
nerve to call me a shrimp.

288
00:19:16,760 --> 00:19:17,940
Hurry up, Bobby.

289
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:20,440
Put it on for me.

290
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:22,350
Fine.

291
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,160
There's no way!

292
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:33,260
I can't believe what I'm
seeing right now! Boo!

293
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:40,477
Boo from the Cardo Kingdom

294
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:42,325
is taking a hell of a beating!

295
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,280
He is down for the count!

296
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:46,680
But who's not punching him?

297
00:19:46,860 --> 00:19:48,877
The cowardly younger brother Bobby?

298
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:51,784
Or could it be the weakling
older brother Kelly?

299
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:54,080
Why, it appears to be Kelly!

300
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:57,781
Surprising, given his
sudden change in appearance!

301
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:00,720
Who you calling a shrimp?

302
00:20:01,100 --> 00:20:02,600
Let that be a lesson!

303
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:06,100
Next time, wise guy,
I'll rip your throat out!

304
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:10,870
Wow!

305
00:20:10,953 --> 00:20:14,188
During this mayhem, it appears
Lucy's helmet got knocked off!

306
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,860
Hey, give that back to me!

307
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,160
You know, I heard a very
peculiar tale, Lucy.

308
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:24,577
A rumor about a pirate with a 400 million
bounty by the name of Straw Hat Luffy.

309
00:20:24,660 --> 00:20:26,920
who secretly entered this competition.

310
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,320
Straw Hat!

311
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:38,680
Don Chin Chow is cutting his way across
the arena, but who's he got his sights on?

312
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:43,720
I sure hope you're watching this, Garp,
because I'm about to kill your grandson.

313
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:49,197
And we are down to the last 40 contenders
remaining in Block C's Battle Royale.

314
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:54,560
The field has been weeded down
to only the strongest fighters.

315
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:58,380
It's anyone's game, but who will win?
